The directory `local-4090/` derives from that project:

  local-4090/mosskit/layout.py    <- src/moss_studio/domain/layout.py
  local-4090/mosskit/masks.py     <- src/moss_studio/domain/masks.py
  local-4090/mosskit/profiles.py  <- configs/profiles/*.json
  local-4090/mosskit/graph.py     <- workflows/*.json

Changes from the original: the layout compiler forces `caption == text` on text
boxes (the original leaves them independent, which leaks caption text into the
render), the feather/compositing code is reduced to the pieces used locally, and
the API graphs are emitted complete instead of being patched at runtime.

